+## Terminal colors
+
+The console uses the attaching terminal's default foreground, background,
+and ANSI palette. Configure the terminal's theme rather than a dekit color
+file. Each attachment resolves those colors independently.
+
+Task output keeps its original default, indexed, and truecolor attributes.
+Selected rows use reverse video. Modal backgrounds do not apply RGB shading
+because that would replace the terminal's own colors.
